From: Chu Qinghao <6337103+qinghao1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] bridge: emit source maps for the headless WASM target

Sidecar .wasm.map for vpinball-headless in every build type so a SIGILL
(or any trap) in the deployed engine maps back to C++ sources in browser
devtools. The map is resolved relative to the .wasm URL, so it keeps
working under any serving subpath. Deployed by wasm/build-headless.sh
next to the .wasm; zero runtime cost (fetched only when devtools open
the file).

Target: vpinball/vpinball@64a480a96d1b972711fbb8eea014654c779b1e23

diff --git a/make/CMakeLists_app.txt b/make/CMakeLists_app.txt
--- a/make/CMakeLists_app.txt
+++ b/make/CMakeLists_app.txt
@@ -1126,7 +1126,16 @@ elseif(PLATFORM STREQUAL "wasm")
       "--preload-file=${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/plugins/nixie/layouts@/plugins/nixie/layouts"
       "--preload-file=${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/plugins/flexdmd/assets@/plugins/flexdmd/assets"
       "--exclude-file=*.vpz"
       "--exclude-file=*/src/assets/web"
    )
 
+   # Emit a sidecar source map for SIGILL triage.
+   target_compile_options(vpinball-headless PRIVATE
+      -gsource-map
+   )
+
+   target_link_options(vpinball-headless PRIVATE
+      -gsource-map
+   )
+
 endif()
